{"version":1,"key":"card:249","content":{"id":249,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"4752b137-79e7-4ec4-b835-74e1a3705973","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变量都是不同的，这是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"639e07c6-ed31-4c43-9ad0-ce505bcf8719","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 不能通过字面量来进行创建，创建 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变量需要通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 来创建"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"be74c557-f078-456c-8c34-333d962fdf38","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"9d8126c3-7688-4463-887a-0b7dae184d95","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const x = Symbol();\n\nconsole.log(typeof x); // symbol","collabId":"dc7c66a9-f6c1-4331-a63e-3b1c61244396","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"456b7c95-2530-4e48-9e55-22a65f464028","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"563b1e69-16e1-4a8d-93c8-1e13d8eda56d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const x = Symbol();\nconst y = Symbol();\nconsole.log(x === y); // false","collabId":"b2b431b8-020a-4f5c-afaa-05b4cd614194","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"09d76cb7-2dad-4428-afb9-86970e88ba8a","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c927d882-be13-49b5-8315-1ca2e548c850","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const x = Symbol();\n\nconst person = {\n  [x]: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nconsole.log(person[x]); // Alice","collabId":"41731fab-fc8e-43df-98c6-b6065ea7b704","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"7795df27-89e4-4118-8c8f-eefa2ed8b59e","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 还可以接收一个字符串作为该 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 变量的描述，该字符串纯粹是为了调试方便而设置的，没有特殊的功能，两个 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量的描述符相同不代表它们是相同，每一个由 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol()"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 创建的变量都是不同的。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"56fe3a96-6b0b-4538-9579-71a225589008","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"c90ce688-71c5-45da-9570-393d77b497a9","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const name = Symbol(\"Alice\");\nconst alice = Symbol(\"Alice\");\n\nconsole.log(name == alice); // false","collabId":"06fee289-efcf-4b5a-88ea-e6f86066f694","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e708be67-b037-418e-bcbe-befbbbf6e227","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型的变量可以作为对象的属性，不仅可以在对象的字面量中通过计算属性进行设置属性，还可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperty"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Object.defineProperties"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 对对象进行定义"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"fb3b97c1-d556-495d-bad2-6f9581727f61","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"277f57aa-f6e1-4bee-84fa-4efe13301a5d","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const first = Symbol(\"first\");\n\nconst alice = {\n  [first]: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nObject.defineProperty(alice, first, {\n  writable: false,\n});\n\nconst last = Symbol(\"last\");\nObject.defineProperties(alice, {\n  [last]: {\n    value: \"Lee\",\n    writable: false,\n  },\n});\n\nconsole.log(alice[first]); // Alice\nconsole.log(alice[last]);  // Lee","collabId":"42ed4199-bdde-4aa0-b645-e96be843326a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"79d5eb29-c35d-48a7-a0a9-664cd2940618","children":[{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型不能转为其他原始类型，其他原始类型也不能转为 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"Symbol"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 类型，强行转换会抛出错误。"}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690985593930,"updateTime":1753699863289,"linkedCards":[{"id":224,"target":{"key":"card:224","type":"card","id":224},"summary":"只有对于可迭代的对象才可以使用 for ... of 语法进行迭代，那什么对象是可迭代的呢，如果一个对象具有 Symbol.iterator 属性，并且是一个函数，该函数返回的是一个迭代器，那么它就是可迭代的，每次我们使用 for ... ...","tags":["JavaScript"]},{"id":250,"target":{"key":"card:250","type":"card","id":250},"summary":"有的时候代码中需要共享一个 Symbol ，ES6 提供了一个全局的 Symbol 管理机构，我们可以在任何时候访问它。我们是通过 Symbol.for 方法来访问这个全局机构的， Symbol.for 接收一个字符串参数，根据这个字符串参...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]},{"id":251,"target":{"key":"card:251","type":"card","id":251},"summary":"Symbol 变量可以作为对象的属性，但是当我们通过 for...in 以及 getOwnPropertyNames 都不能获得 Symbol 属性 let age = Symbol(\"age\"); let person = { name:...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]},{"id":252,"target":{"key":"card:252","type":"card","id":252},"summary":"instanceof 是用来判断某个对象是否是某个函数的实例，如果该函数在这个对象的原型链上，那么这个对象就是这个函数的实例。在 ES6 中，我们可以 Symbol.hasInstance 来改变这一默认行为 obj instanceof ...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol","JavaScript/原型","JavaScript/instanceof"]},{"id":253,"target":{"key":"card:253","type":"card","id":253},"summary":"数组的 concat 方法的作用是将两个数组拼接起来，然后返回一个新的数组 let colors1 = [\"red\", \"green\"]; let colors2 = colors1.concat([\"white\", \"blue\"]); c...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1753699863289}}